[b]0.2.9[/b]
[list]
[*]Touch-STS2 options now appear in RitsuLib's Mod Settings. Removed the separate BaseLib and ModConfig entries. Existing preferences are preserved.
[*]The mouse cursor stays visible in Mod Settings, making it easier to turn touchscreen mode off.
[*]The description now starts with the manual activation instructions: Settings → Input → Touchscreen mode.
[/list]

[list]
[*]Touch-STS2 的选项现在接入 RitsuLib 的“模组设置”，不再接入 BaseLib 和 ModConfig 的配置入口。已有设置保持不变。
[*]“模组设置”页面保留鼠标光标，方便关闭触屏模式。
[*]描述开头已强调需要手动开启，并给出原生路径：设置 → 操作设置 → 触屏模式。
[/list]
